        -:  164: *     10 = is-ASCII (positive-only: string is all-ASCII)
        -:  165: *     11 = both cached
        -:  166: *   Bits [29:0]  = codepoint count (max ~1 billion)
        -:  167: *
        -:  168: * Bit 31 = is-ASCII flag (set = all-ASCII; clear = unknown/non-ASCII)
        -:  169: * Bit 30 = cp-count-cached flag
        -:  170: * Bits [29:0] = codepoint count (meaningful only when bit 30 = 1)
        -:  171: * ================================================================ */
